LAME JavaScript MP3 encoder (v1.02 local copy)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
public/vendor/lame.min.js is the unmodified lamejs 1.2.1 distribution by
zhuker and contributors, using the LAME encoder under the LGPL. Its upstream
license notice is included as public/vendor/lame-LICENSE.txt.
Upstream source and build instructions: https://github.com/zhuker/lamejs
LAME project and licensing: https://lame.sourceforge.net/
The script is loaded separately; this release does not modify the encoder.

The v1.02 easter-egg SVG badges and offline article placeholder are original
project assets replacing remote image dependencies, under this project's license.
